WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,150
By the way, let out the water, Xue Mei, let out the water.

2
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:13,870
What is that?

3
00:00:13,870 --> 00:00:16,870
Thralls and Cryptmen, shadowy crawling humanoid monsters

4
00:00:16,870 --> 00:00:20,870
Servants of the past, they are afraid of the sun and thirst for blood

5
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:26,580
What would happen if I really fell in?

6
00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:28,580
Eaten alive by that thing and drink blood

7
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:31,610
Okay, come down first

8
00:00:31,610 --> 00:00:33,610
I never thought this grassland could be so dangerous

9
00:00:33,610 --> 00:00:35,610
Not just wolves but cavemen

10
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:38,610
That senior, let's tie him up and walk together. It'll be safer this way.

11
00:00:39,610 --> 00:00:40,610
Find the box first

12
00:00:40,610 --> 00:00:42,610
These cavemen don't come out of the ground during the day
